  "<span>Target titles</span><strong class=\"looking-strong\">Head of Platform Engineering</strong> · Platform Engineering Manager / Director · Head of Developer Experience (DevEx) · Engineering Manager, IDP · Head of Software Engineering Office":
    "<span>Puestos objetivo</span><strong class=\"looking-strong\">Head of Platform Engineering</strong> · Platform Engineering Manager / Director · Head of Developer Experience (DevEx) · Engineering Manager, IDP · Head of Software Engineering Office",
